Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼哼哼 哼哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 光... 光芒... 消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天行者们的路标 晴朗宝石的光芒消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法在晚间飞行 民众们都很困扰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.47,0:00:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由由博士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.79,0:00:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有办法恢复光芒的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.51,0:00:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有比我更适合这个任务的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:42.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,务必交给他来处理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:47.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴朗宝石好像就在那座岛上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:50.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是从没有人踏足过的浮岛啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.75,0:00:56.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 我们走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}拯救蓝天！浮岛的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:42.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴朗宝石是从久远以前就闪耀着光芒的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.87,0:02:46.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,据说不会暗淡 永远照耀世间...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:51.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,别看我很了解的样子 其实也是从由由阿姨收藏的古籍里学到的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.51,0:02:53.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,并没有亲眼见过...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:56.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,可为什么会把这件事委托给少年呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也问过理由的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 想要委托给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:05.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我能够办到吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定可以解决这个问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:18.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,被这么一说 我就...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:23.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年！自信一点 咱们走！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼没有问题的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:27.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.09,0:03:30.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:36.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实惠 实惠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 我要这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去那家店看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.77,0:03:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天有什么推荐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 快看！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:47.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害！像是在过节一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:48.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.97,0:03:53.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是给旅行者提供餐点和这种休息方式的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:56.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那个吊床是叶子诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.86,0:03:58.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:00.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是风曳树的叶子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:04.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是一种能够抵抗暴风的坚韧叶子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:08.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们要找的人是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么可能飞得到！你看看！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上空是紊乱气流 压根没法稳定飞行！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.81,0:04:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扎进那云里 铁定了是飞不出来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:28.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,能够掌握气流走向的话 就能飞了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:35.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我来判断风向 看我的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:38.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是为了烦恼中的群众！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:39.46,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！干就干吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都看不到 风也强得离谱！都说过不行的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:56.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,请往正上方飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:05:01.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,撞到了那座小岛的暖气流正在向上升
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:03.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,请向着那个方向飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 你们抓紧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:16.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,上空有冷气流下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.95,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,乘着这股风 往下降！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,接着向上！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:45.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快看！是岛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就在这里等你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:54.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是未有人踏足过的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:05:59.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:00.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:03.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我感觉到了什么的气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是动物啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:07.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会是猛兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.58,0:06:10.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.34,0:06:15.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,在这么高处的岛 也就只有会飞行的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:16.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:19.44,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,你害怕吗 还行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:24.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的 好了 让我们一往直前！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:27.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一往... 直前...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:30.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都走不到岛中心呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:34.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,应该差不多该到了... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:41.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这是... 这么大的风曳树！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.14,0:06:43.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:45.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:49.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我就是好奇 捡起来看看...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:52.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 好像有点提神效果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:54.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:56.43,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也要！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:59.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们走一个！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:00.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:01.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:04.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,也太猛了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那边是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:13.27,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,岛的中心地带！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:19.95,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴朗宝石就在那塔的顶部...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:23.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要爬那塔... 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:24.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:32.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 大... 大...大伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（响声！）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:37.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,来者何人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（低吼）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（响声！）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怪...怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们来干嘛的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:25.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.73,0:08:29.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非 你们就是龙族的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:31.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,龙族？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是又怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:38.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,感动啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:40.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(575,1055)}诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不害怕我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:44.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:49.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可是传说里 很久以前在蓝天大地曾存在过的龙族啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:49.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1070,965)}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:52.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我在书里看到过 能亲眼见到太荣幸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:54.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我是嘟嘟鸟族的翼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:02.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,因为晴朗宝石的光芒消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.74,0:09:05.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来到这岛上 寻求恢复的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.85,0:09:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴...晴朗宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:10.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才他肉眼可见地动摇了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不是的 我们只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:16.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,群众们正在因为无法夜间飞行而烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:20.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要是知道什么情况 请告诉我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:24.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想帮助蓝天大地的人们！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.97,0:09:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:30.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.39,0:09:33.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是真心想要恢复宝石的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:42.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:45.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是... 晴朗宝石！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 为什么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.16,0:09:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有理由的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:52.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,什么理由？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们龙族 从祖上至今都有着守护晴朗宝石的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:09:58.84,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天夜里... 宝石的光芒不够亮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就擦了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:10.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？宝石不是不会暗淡永远闪耀的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们集中精神进行作业...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果脚底下塌了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来的你们都看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶点一块的楼梯塌了 我们无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:34.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:39.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,请游览大鸟带我们上去的话 就能恢复原位了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 那真帮大忙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:47.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,知道是龙族在守护宝石 蓝天大地的人们也会来协助的...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.15,0:10:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能跟任何人说！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的事情 你们一定要保密...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.10,0:10:57.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,为... 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为会吓到蓝天大地的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:04.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为人们害怕我们的祖先 才无法共存的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以说是逃到这座岛上的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:20.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们的祖先发现了晴朗宝石 放置在山岩上的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:24.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,为了蓝天大地的人们 不会在夜间迷失方向
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:28.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明明都遭人白眼了 为什么还会...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道呢？大概是因为龙族的传统吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之就是 我们再次出现在人们面前的话 肯定还会吓到他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:39.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能这么想...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一代代蜗居在这里 我们的飞羽已经退化了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都无法飞行了 压根出不了这座岛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.55,0:11:52.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:53.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:59.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然还有龙族 很有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么又是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:05.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:15.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什...什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:19.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:21.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
