Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:22.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是什么来头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:32.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在 快去安全的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好的...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:37.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这里哪有安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:42.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:44.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:48.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:52.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:05.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:08.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:09.79,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:22.27,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:25.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:28.95,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:35.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴兽的藤蔓连接着这岛上的所有藤蔓
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:37.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴朗宝石交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:50.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经无法飞行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:58.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使能够飞行 除了这座岛 我们也没有别的地方能去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没有这回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:06.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,被人惧怕 只是祖上传下来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.47,0:16:10.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,各位并没有见过蓝天大地的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:15.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不敢保证就没有人会害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:19.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 肯定会有像我们这样 能够接纳你们的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:29.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.13,0:16:35.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,风曳树的叶子... 有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:37.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,各位！用那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,把那些叶子当作飞羽 飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:45.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我来吸引注意力！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:47.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,趁这个机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可... 可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:54.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞出岛外吧！迈出这第一步！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔... 飞得那么高...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.69,0:17:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！抓住叶子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们飞起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:23.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,只要继续飞行...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,无用功
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:41.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,僵持下去的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:49.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞出岛外吧！迈出这第一步！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞起来了！用我自己的飞羽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:17.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有了...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.98,0:18:23.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们无处可逃 能追到你们天涯海角
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:27.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就发挥你的这种特性！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:39.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:42.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶... 凶暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:46.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
